    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Your Tux Back!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BlokhedJelli is a 2D platforming collect-a-thon that takes you on an adventure to different worlds; each with its own theme and strange inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Froggy has stolen a fancy tuxedo to make himself more charismatic and is using his new image to trick others into spreading the seeds of a mysterious flower he found.  Unfortunately for him, the tux he stole belongs to Blokhed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Blokhed, the straight-laced organizer, and Jelli, the messy prankster.  While exploring different worlds infested with mysterious flowers, they must move past their differences, get Blokhed's tuxedo back, and save their infested worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Find and Collect jellis, hunny buns, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Rival Bosses that evolve based on how you treat your foes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Explore 8 Different Worlds and Over 40 Levels! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Exciting 2D Action Platforming!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Save or Defeat Your Enemies to stop Froggy and get your tux back! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p>",
